# halo.px - orbiting satellite drone
# canvas 10x10, 2 frames (pulse pair, loop). Top-down; round so it needs no facing.
# light: top-left (ring lit top-left 6/5, falling to 3/2 bottom-right).
# outline: K exterior circle; K inner ring separates the steel ring from the cyan core.
# smallest must-read feature: cyan core 2x2 (frame a); in frame b the core blooms into the K gap (4x4).
# anchor: frame centre (5,5).
# timing: a 200 ms, b 117 ms (core flashes briefly, rests longer).
palette
. transparent
2 #2f3a5a  steel-1
3 #4a5a82  steel-2
4 #7184ad  steel-3
5 #a7b8d8  steel-4
6 #e4ecfa  steel-5
C #1d86b8  cyan-1
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
b #46c8ee  cyan-2
w #b2f4ff  cyan-3 glint
ramp steel 2 3 4 5 6
ramp cyan C b w
frame a 200
...KKKK...
.KK6655KK.
.K665554K.
K665KK543K
K65KwbK43K
K54KbCK32K
K543KK322K
.K443222K.
.KK3322KK.
...KKKK...
frame b 117
...KKKK...
.KK6655KK.
.K665554K.
K665bb543K
